==Strategy==
It is very easy to deal with this giant swarm of enemies using lots of piercers and Area Attackers. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] are a given, but you can also use [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Ranger]] to better control them. The most dangerous enemies here are the Zories, so bring Holy Blast to unburrow one of them, as well as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] to catch the rest as they surface.

